<title>USA: Court okays Fruehauf $35 mln DIP financing.</title>
<headline>Court okays Fruehauf $35 mln DIP financing.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANPOLIS, Ind. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fruehauf Trailer Corp said on Monday the U.S. Bankruptcy Court in the District of Delaware approved its debtor-in-possession financing facility, enabling it to borrow up to $35 million, from Madeline LLC.</p>
<p>But the company said it expected the facility would increase to $55 million, at the final court hearing scheduled for October 25.</p>
</text>
